      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA DETONATOR (2) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 5.5 lengths at this track in a handy 30.13 beating GYPSY GIRL PEARL. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. TERRA BELLA (1) jumps from box 1 for the first time after placing latest at this track (30.17) in a Grade 5. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Must be included in calculations. BAGLESS BRUTE (3) goes very well over this track and trip including three wins. Hit the frame latest (19.13) when third at Q Straight in a Restricted WIN. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. BIONIC BILL (7) profiles nicely here at this trip.",
